-- Seed data: canonical tango artists sourced from the ingestion pipeline's MusicBrainz/Deezer
-- matching (see ../../../ingestion/README.md). `display_name` is the MusicBrainz name;
-- `external_ids` always carries the MusicBrainz id and additionally carries the Deezer id for
-- artists with a *confirmed* MusicBrainz<->Deezer match. Each INSERT is a `WHERE NOT EXISTS`
-- guarded by the MusicBrainz id so this file is safe to re-run.
--
-- Regenerate this file (after re-running ingestion matching) with:
--   psql "$INGESTION_POSTGRES_DSN" -t -A -f ../ingestion/queries/generate_artist_seed.sql \
--     > src/migrations/0004_seed_artists.sql
